# Measuring Verdict Distribution Drift with Jensen-Shannon Divergence

> **Archive and transfer scope.** The technical text below comes from an archived draft. Historical statements about pending draft translations or an absent Learn import or build refer to that earlier stage; this [transfer record](../../../../code/streeling/evidence/representation-release-2026-10-22/README.md) records the current translation drafts, import and checks. Other unexecuted-experiment boundaries remain in force. Human subject, fluent-language and learner reviews remain pending.

